                     <summary>Flemish decoration, written in England. (<ref
                           target="https://catalog.hathitrust.org/Record/000468709">Pächt and
                           Alexander</ref> i. 348, pl. XXVII). Illuminated initials and borders at the beginning of the Hours of the Lady office and the main parts of the volume, on the opposite pages full-page miniatures within borders.</summary>
                     <decoNote type="miniature">Good miniatures. </decoNote>
                     <decoNote type="histInit">Good historiated initials. </decoNote>
                     <decoNote type="decInit">Good other initials. </decoNote>
